  message: "Dogfooding (blinded severity 3/5) — SECOND distinct facet folded here: 5 wgsl nodes carry bare-16-hex fingerprints with NO `hgfp1:` prefix because wgsl.py stamps a literal `sha256(source_bytes)[:16]` while everything else uses the prefixed structural-CST-walk hash — two algorithms under one symbol_fingerprint_scheme=v1. Fix: make wgsl.py defer to the central compute_symbol_fingerprint (or have the stamper normalize non-None foreign-format fingerprints) — one stamp-site change fixes both prefix + algorithm. [dogfood]"  # 078f
